# tof_silent_api_takeoff.expect — the accident chain through the Tello-style API
# Tello 風 API を通した事故の連鎖
#
# API takeoff -> ARM -> auto-takeoff climb -> ToF output stops -> TAKEOFF -> LANDING (the climb is
# aborted, FLYING is never reached) -> the API replies "error takeoff aborted" without waiting out
# its 12 s timeout -> a second takeoff is refused up front.
# API 離陸 → ARM → 自動離陸の上昇 → ToF 出力停止 → TAKEOFF → LANDING（上昇を中止。FLYING には
# 到達しない）→ API は 12 s のタイムアウトを待たずに "error takeoff aborted" を返す →
# 2 回目の離陸は最初に拒否される。
exit 0
log_contains any "cmd: takeoff"
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff engaged"
log_contains any "Downward ToF silent (>= 300 ms without a sample) in TAKEOFF/POS_HOLD → LANDING"
log_contains any "Blind landing: ToF silent, velocity loop"
log_contains any "reply: error takeoff aborted"
log_contains any "reply: error tof silent - check the sensor"
log_absent any "reply: error takeoff timeout"
log_absent any "Transition: TAKEOFF → FLYING"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "in TAKEOFF/POS_HOLD → LANDING"
order "in TAKEOFF/POS_HOLD → LANDING" "reply: error takeoff aborted"
order "reply: error takeoff aborted" "reply: error tof silent - check the sensor"
# The aborted climb stays low: measured alt_max 0.177 m (ToF stops 6.8 s; 0.405 m with the open-loop ramp of
# the first fix); bound 0.30 m. The craft comes down by the velocity loop at a measured 0.43 m/s (bound
# 0.6 m/s) and rests on the floor afterwards.
# 中止した上昇は低く収まる: 実測 alt_max 0.177 m（ToF 停止 6.8 s。最初の修正の開ループのランプでは 0.405 m）、
# 上限 0.30 m。機体は速度ループで実測 0.43 m/s で降り（上限 0.6 m/s）、その後は床の上で静止する。
metric alt_max < 0.30 in 6.0 9.0
# 2026-11-09 (5th review): bound 0.6 -> 1.0 m/s (measured 0.43 -> 0.81 m/s). The thrust of the descent without a ToF is now at most 0.95 x the support thrust
# (it cannot climb whatever the velocity estimate says), so once the velocity target is reached the descent speed is set by that ceiling (0.05 g) instead of by the PI.
# 2026-11-09（5 回目の見直し）: 上限 0.6 → 1.0 m/s（実測 0.43 → 0.81 m/s）。ToF なしの降下の推力は高々 支持推力の 0.95 倍（速度推定が何であれ上昇できない）になり、
# 速度の目標に達した後の降下速度は PI でなくその上限（0.05 g）で決まる。
metric descent_speed_max < 1.0 in 6.8 12.0
metric alt_max < 0.05 in 11.0 14.0
